.claude/
.env*

# fb-monitor extraction output — contains scraped personal data, never commit
scripts/fb-monitor/out/

# supabase CLI scratch — project ref, pooler URL, cached tool versions
supabase/.temp/

# Documents dropped into public/ are served at the site root, with no auth and
# nothing to stop a crawler. On 2026-10-08 a 9.2MB proof-of-address PDF was
# sitting in public/images/ — untracked, so never exposed, but one `git add .`
# away from living at mountainconnects.com/images/<name>.pdf forever. Nothing
# in this project serves a PDF deliberately; if that ever changes, allow that
# one file explicitly rather than removing this rule.
public/**/*.pdf
